    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used an AI chatbot recently to review complex proofs. It explained concepts clearly, which helped me understand better. The interaction felt like tutoring, and since I'm not afraid of making mistakes with AI, I asked many questions until everything clicked for me.",
