    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can act as personalized tutors that adapt explanations to a student's level. They can generate practice problems instantly and provide instant feedback. This helps students like me who learn faster when they can ask questions without fear of judgment, making math less intimidating and more engaging."
